9015.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it disgraces him", "bs": "sramoti ga", "tr": "onu rezil eder", "fr": "il le couvre de honte", "id": "dia mempermalukannya", "ur": "وہ اسے رسوا کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে তাকে অপমানিত করে", "fa": "او را رسوا می‌کند"}}, {"text": "وَيَحِلُّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّقِيمٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "15:69", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1871.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And keep your duty to Allah, and shame me not!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Allah'tan korkun! Beni mahcub etmeyin.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اللہ سے ڈرو اور مجھے رسوا نہ کرو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan bertakwalah kepada Allah dan janganlah kamu membuat aku terhina\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُخْزُونِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/86fefcdad753b2668409.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sramotite me", "en": "disgrace me", "tr": "beni utandırmayın", "fr": "ne me couvrez pas de honte", "id": "hinakanlah aku", "ur": "تم مجھے رسوا کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা আমাকে লাঞ্ছিত করো (না)", "fa": "مرا رسوا مکنید"}}]}, {"ref": "3:192", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/485.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Our Lord! Whom Thou causest to enter the Fire: him indeed Thou hast confounded. For evil-doers there will be no helpers.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Rabbimiz! Sen kimi cehennem ateşine sokarsan onu rezil etmişsindir. Zalimlerin hiç yardımcıları yoktur\".", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے رب ہمارے! بیشک جسے تو دوزخ میں لے جائے اسے ضرور تو نے رسوائی دی اور ظالموں کا کوئی مددگار نہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Ya Tuhan kami, sesungguhnya barangsiapa yang Engkau masukkan ke dalam neraka, maka sungguh telah Engkau hinakan ia, dan tidak ada bagi orang-orang yang zalim seorang penolongpun.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "رَبَّنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُدْخِلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَخْزَيْتَهُۥ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ab95b3e46c5256d5fda5.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "osramotio si ga", "en": "You have disgraced him", "tr": "onu rezil ettin", "fr": "Tu l'as couvert de honte", "id": "Engkau telah menghinakannya", "ur": "تو نے اسے رسوا کیا", "bn": "আপনি তাকে অপমানিত করেছেন", "fa": "او را رسوا کرده‌ای"}}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلظَّٰلِمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنصَارٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "26:87", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3019.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And abase me not on the day when they are raised,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930),